    "titleZh": "修訂報價",
    "topic": "manufacturing",
    "passage": "Woman: Your quotation assumes one thousand units a month. Our forecast is only six hundred units per month for the first quarter.\nMan: I can revise the unit price for that volume. Will you still use the same enclosure and packaging?\nWoman: The enclosure is unchanged. Please pack the units in plain boxes, with nothing printed on them. Show the packaging cost separately.\nMan: Certainly. I will email a revised quotation by tomorrow afternoon.",
    "passageZh": "女：你們的報價假設每月一千台。我們預估第一季每月只有六百台。\n男：我可以依那個數量修改單價。外殼和包裝仍使用相同的嗎？\n女：外殼不變。請用無印刷紙箱裝這批產品。請把包裝費用分開列出。\n男：當然。我最遲會在明天下午寄出修訂報價。",
    "audioScript": "Your quotation assumes one thousand units a month. Our forecast is only six hundred units per month for the first quarter.\nI can revise the unit price for that volume. Will you still use the same enclosure and packaging?\nThe enclosure is unchanged. Please pack the units in plain boxes, with nothing printed on them. Show the packaging cost separately.\nCertainly. I will email a revised quotation by tomorrow afternoon.",
    "turns": [
