        "text": "I can revise the unit price for that volume. Will you still use the same enclosure and packaging?"
      },
      {
        "voice": "female",
        "text": "The enclosure is unchanged. Please pack the units in plain boxes, with nothing printed on them. Show the packaging cost separately."
      },
      {
        "voice": "male",
        "text": "Certainly. I will email a revised quotation by tomorrow afternoon."
      }
    ],
